WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.668 --> 00:00:04.237
NARRATOR: Next day back in the
Polynesian town of Papetoai,

00:00:04.304 --> 00:00:08.508
they visit an expert who
ID sharks by their fins.

00:00:08.575 --> 00:00:10.110
So we were hoping to
see if you could look

00:00:10.176 --> 00:00:12.278
through some of your databases.

00:00:12.345 --> 00:00:13.680
NARRATOR: Shark
scientist Nicolas

00:00:13.747 --> 00:00:18.184
Buray keeps a photo archive
of Tahitian tiger sharks.

00:00:18.251 --> 00:00:19.052
That's cool.

00:00:19.119 --> 00:00:21.688
NARRATOR: And it's been growing.

00:00:21.755 --> 00:00:23.490
MAN: How many sharks do
you have in your database?

00:00:23.556 --> 00:00:26.192
So in our database,
we have around 55

00:00:26.259 --> 00:00:28.261
different tiger sharks.

00:00:28.328 --> 00:00:29.696
This is new.

00:00:29.763 --> 00:00:32.399
For 10 years, I
saw maybe two only.

00:00:32.465 --> 00:00:34.601
Right now, since three,
four, five years,

00:00:34.667 --> 00:00:37.170
we are more and
more tiger sharks.

00:00:37.237 --> 00:00:40.473
NARRATOR: Local divers send
Nicolas dorsal fin shots.

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:44.711
He enters them into the archive
and identifies the individuals.

00:00:44.778 --> 00:00:46.212
So you're looking at
the stripe patterns?

00:00:46.279 --> 00:00:47.380
Yeah, the stripe.

00:00:47.447 --> 00:00:52.085
When a shark's growing,
they keep the same stripe.

00:00:52.152 --> 00:00:55.522
NARRATOR: All of the
newcomers are females.

00:00:55.588 --> 00:00:59.359
Time to find out if
they have a match.

00:00:59.426 --> 00:01:01.728
This one here is Kamakai.

00:01:01.795 --> 00:01:04.130
And the dorsal is
pretty distinct.

00:01:04.197 --> 00:01:08.301
She is mature, so
there's some scarring.

00:01:08.368 --> 00:01:10.036
NARRATOR: During
mating, male sharks

00:01:10.103 --> 00:01:14.040
bite the females, which
is why female shark skin

00:01:14.107 --> 00:01:15.575
has evolved to be super thick.

00:01:18.311 --> 00:01:23.616
Female tigers reach sexual
maturity at about 9 years.

00:01:23.683 --> 00:01:27.821
There's no doubt
Kamakai has mated.

00:01:27.887 --> 00:01:29.589
Clearly a big
female tiger shark.

00:01:29.656 --> 00:01:30.857
But do you recognize her?

00:01:30.924 --> 00:01:32.992
Or is she in your database?

00:01:33.059 --> 00:01:34.027
I mean, no.
No.

00:01:34.093 --> 00:01:35.328
Not in my database.

00:01:35.395 --> 00:01:36.162
ANDY: OK.

00:01:36.229 --> 00:01:37.163
No.

00:01:37.230 --> 00:01:39.966
This one is, I'm
sure I don't know it.

00:01:40.033 --> 00:01:41.334
NARRATOR: Now they
compare pictures

00:01:41.401 --> 00:01:47.240
from the database with the big
females from the night dive.

00:01:47.307 --> 00:01:49.576
This is the biggest one
that we've seen there.

00:01:49.642 --> 00:01:52.312
We were thinking
possibly the same shark.

00:01:52.378 --> 00:01:53.112
No.

00:01:53.179 --> 00:01:54.113
For me, it's not the same.

00:01:54.180 --> 00:01:56.983
So this one I think
is not the same.

00:01:57.050 --> 00:01:58.351
NARRATOR: Andy
and Kori have just

00:01:58.418 --> 00:02:02.088
added three new large females
to Nico's growing database.

00:02:02.155 --> 00:02:03.590
Do have the other side?

00:02:03.656 --> 00:02:04.924
No.

00:02:04.991 --> 00:02:07.193
NARRATOR: That makes more
than 40 large sexually mature

00:02:07.260 --> 00:02:10.630
female tiger sharks,
most with dorsal fins

00:02:10.697 --> 00:02:13.233
chewed up and
scarred for mating.

00:02:13.299 --> 00:02:16.369
Looks like just
a shredded fin.

00:02:16.436 --> 00:02:19.906
NARRATOR: Everything points to
a tiger shark mating ground.

00:02:19.973 --> 00:02:23.776
An area with males
must be nearby.

00:02:23.843 --> 00:02:25.945
So that means those other hot
spots out there, other places

00:02:26.012 --> 00:02:27.881
where these large tiger
sharks are hanging out

00:02:27.947 --> 00:02:29.949
that haven't been studied yet.

00:02:30.016 --> 00:02:32.652
NARRATOR: If they can find
it, perhaps Kamakai will

00:02:32.719 --> 00:02:35.855
be there looking for a mate.

